  "limitations": [
    "synthetic documents drawn in the real family; the only real page is the fixture's render, not a camera capture",
    "page furniture (titles, headings) is located but not transcribed",
    "characters are read one by one; a missed character usually loses its whole field, which is why refusal, not accuracy, is the safety property",
    "row grouping, the row pairing and the column split are decoding rules, not learned; a row is paired only where the pairing is unambiguous, so rows closer together than the decoding jitter are refused rather than confirmed against a neighbour"
  ]
